Simple demo of rrenc/rrdec/m2cdm

protect.bat - computes protection and prepares m2cdm's paramfile
recover.bat - makes restoration; single parameter required - target-dir
protect.lst - source file for computing protection
              (see at end of rrenc's --help for syntax)

protect.bat will create three new files:
_recvr_\protection.rrd  - redundant data
_recvr_\protection.rrt  - control file for rrdec
                          (see at end of rrdec's --help for syntax)
image\example-image.um2 - control file for m2cdm to create disc image
